prompts:
Use case: precise-object-edit / identity-preserve.
Image 1 is the EDIT TARGET: an 8-column, 4-row transparent Snowcap sprite sheet. Image 2 is the original identity reference.
Repair the temporal continuity of ONLY rows 2 and 4 in image1. Preserve row1 idle and row3 jumping as closely as possible, preserve the 8x4 equal-cell layout, transparency, scale, feet baseline, pink twins tails, star eyes, gold pins, white cub and bow, black cat and purple cape. Crisp pixel art. Do not redesign the character.
ROW2 WAVE correction: the SAME arm on the VIEWER'S LEFT waves in all 8 cells; the OTHER arm continuously cradles the black cat. No swapping arms. Exactly this progression, left to right:
1 both hands resting around cat (neutral);
2 viewer-left hand beginning to lift at the cat's shoulder height;
3 viewer-left elbow lifted, hand halfway toward the girl's cheek;
4 viewer-left paw next to cheek/ear, fully raised;
5 same raised paw rotated a little outward;
6 same raised paw rotated a little inward;
7 same paw lowered halfway back toward cat;
8 both hands resting around cat, identical to frame1.
The raising and lowering must have actual in-between poses, not 8 fully raised hands. Keep head and body in the same place throughout.
ROW4 TURN correction: no contradictory left/right views. Eight successive standing directions rotating at equal 45-degree steps in ONE CONSISTENT direction. From left to right:
1 FRONT facing toward viewer/down.
2 FRONT-RIGHT three-quarter: nose points toward RIGHT edge, most of face visible.
3 RIGHT PROFILE: nose points toward RIGHT edge, head in side view.
4 BACK-RIGHT three-quarter: back of head mostly visible, face/cat only visible on RIGHT edge.
5 BACK: rear of pink hair and purple cape, no full face visible.
6 BACK-LEFT three-quarter: back of head mostly visible, face/cat only visible on LEFT edge.
7 LEFT PROFILE: nose points toward LEFT edge, head in side view.
8 FRONT-LEFT three-quarter: nose points toward LEFT edge, most of face visible.
Only one whole sprite per cell, planted feet, same body height, no extra ground, grid, labels, checkerboard or background. Genuine transparent alpha.
